  "as_of": "2023-05-25",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would amend veterans' legislation concerning firefighter compensation, employment program income, rent assistance during overseas absences and support for grandparents caring for veterans' children.",
   "For defence firefighters, it would reduce the oesophageal cancer qualifying period from 25 years to 15 years and broaden the test for relevant firefighting duties.",
   "The changes would begin at Royal Assent and extend acute support eligibility to further grandparent carers, including those parenting children of deceased veterans."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Specified employment program payments could be excluded from veterans' income support means tests.",
   "The bill would permit rent assistance beyond 26 weeks overseas when eligible recipients cannot return because of specified events.",
   "The firefighter amendments would cover relevant oesophageal cancer sustained on or after 4 July 2011."
  ],
  "affected": "Defence firefighters, veterans receiving income support or rent assistance, and eligible grandparent carers and children are affected.",
